# Whitelist entry GRAN_MODEL(LUDING, TANGENTIAL_HISTORY, COHESION_OFF,
# ROLLING_LUDING, SURFACE_DEFAULT) (LIGGGHTS modernization branch, build agent).
# rolling_friction luding with the Luding normal model (which stores the kc/fo
# history that rolling luding reads), for pair gran and wall/gran. The CTest
# test whitelist_luding_rolling_luding requires "Loop time" and fails on the
# runtime-fallback warning ("is not in the static contact-model whitelist").
atom_style granular
atom_modify map array
boundary f f f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
region domain block -0.01 0.01 -0.01 0.01 0.0 0.03 units box
create_box 1 domain
neighbor 0.0004 bin
neigh_modify delay 0
fix m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 5.e6
fix m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.45
fix m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix m5 all property/global characteristicVelocity scalar 1.0
fix m6 all property/global LoadingStiffness peratomtypepair 1 500.0
fix m7 all property/global UnloadingStiffness peratomtypepair 1 5.0
fix m8 all property/global coefficientAdhesionStiffness peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix m9 all property/global coefficientPlasticityDepth peratomtypepair 1 0.1
fix m10 all property/global pullOffForce peratomtypepair 1 0.0
fix m11 all property/global coefficientRollingFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.1
fix m12 all property/global coefficientRollingViscousDamping peratomtypepair 1 0.3
fix m13 all property/global coeffRollingStiffness peratomtypepair 1 1.0
pair_style gran model luding tangential history rolling_friction luding
pair_coeff * *
timestep 1e-5
fix gravi all gravity 9.81 vector 0.0 0.0 -1.0
fix zwall all wall/gran model luding tangential history rolling_friction luding primitive type 1 zplane 0.0
fix pts1 all particletemplate/sphere 15485863 atom_type 1 density constant 2500 radius constant 0.001
fix pdd1 all particledistribution/discrete 32452843 1 pts1 1.0
region bc block -0.009 0.009 -0.009 0.009 0.001 0.029 units box
fix ins all insert/pack seed 32452867 distributiontemplate pdd1 vel constant 0.1 -0.05 -0.5 &
    insert_every once overlapcheck yes all_in yes particles_in_region 100 region bc
fix integr all nve/sphere
thermo_style custom step atoms ke
thermo 500
run 2000
